# The content tree is generated by `cargo run -p xtask -- docs-site`, never committed. The precedent
# is the npm package's README: generated, ignored, and its `package.json` committed beside it. A
# committed copy of a derived tree is a second source of truth, and this repository has none.
/docs/

# Docusaurus build output and its caches.
/build/
/.docusaurus/
.cache-loader/

# npm
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
